{"macroExportVersion": 1, "macro": {"m_name": "Lucid Dreaming - Reality Checks", "m_description": "Shows a random reality check as a notification at random intervals (30-180 min) between 09:00 and 23:00. The timer for the next one starts as soon as it is displayed; a notification that is still open is replaced by the next one. Debug: set the local variable rc_debug to true.", "m_enabled": true, "m_completed": true, "m_GUID": 0, "aiGenerated": 1, "localVariables": [{"m_name": "rc_debug", "m_type": 0, "m_booleanValue": false, "isLocalVar": true}, {"m_name": "rc_naechste_zeit", "m_type": 1, "m_intValue": 0, "isLocalVar": true}, {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "m_stringValue": "", "isLocalVar": true}, {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "m_intValue": 0, "isLocalVar": true}, {"m_name": "warte_minuten", "m_type": 1, "m_intValue": 30, "isLocalVar": true}], "m_triggerList": [{"m_classType": "RegularIntervalTrigger", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_seconds": 900, "m_ignoreReferenceStartTime": true, "m_useAlarm": true, "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "TimeOfDayConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_startHour": 9, "m_startMinute": 0, "m_endHour": 23, "m_endMinute": 0}]}, {"m_classType": "RegularIntervalTrigger", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_seconds": 30, "m_ignoreReferenceStartTime": true, "m_useAlarm": false, "m_comment": "Debug-Tick: nur aktiv wenn rc_debug=true, kein Zeitfenster", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_debug", "m_type": 0, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_booleanValue": true}]}], "m_actionList": [{"m_classType": "IfConditionAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_naechste_zeit", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intLessThan": true, "m_expression": "{system_time}"}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intRandom": true, "m_intRandomMin": 0, "m_intRandomMax": 14}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Pinch your nose shut and inhale. Is air flowing?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 0}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Count the fingers on your right hand. Exactly 5 and stable?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 1}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Press your index finger firmly into your left palm. Does it sink in?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 2}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Read a word, look away, read it again. Did it change?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 3}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Flip a light switch off and on. Does the light respond normally?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 4}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Look around: any recurring dream elements nearby?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 5}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "How did you get here? Can you trace the whole way without gaps?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 6}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Check shadows, reflections, patterns. Does everything look consistent?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 7}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Read the time, look away, read it again. Still the same?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 8}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Jump briefly. Do you land immediately and normally?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 9}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Look into the nearest mirror. Does your reflection look normal?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 10}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "What day of the week is it? Did you know instantly and with certainty?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 11}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Listen for 5 seconds. Do all the sounds match your surroundings?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 12}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Touch a surface. Does it feel the way you'd expect?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 13}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_text", "m_type": 2, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_newStringValue": "Look at your screen. Is the content normal and stable?", "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_index", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intValue": 14}]}, {"m_classType": "NotificationAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_notificationSubject": "Reality Check", "m_notificationText": "{lv=rc_text}", "m_overwriteExisting": true, "m_priority": 2, "autoExpand": true, "notificationIdString": "reality_check_notif"}, {"m_classType": "IfConditionAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_constraintList": [{"m_classType": "MacroDroidVariableConstraint", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_debug", "m_type": 0, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_booleanValue": true}]}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "warte_minuten", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intRandom": true, "m_intRandomMin": 20, "m_intRandomMax": 40}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_naechste_zeit", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intExpression": true, "m_expression": "{system_time} + {lv=warte_minuten}"}, {"m_classType": "ElseAction", "m_SIGUID": 0}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "warte_minuten", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intRandom": true, "m_intRandomMin": 30, "m_intRandomMax": 180}, {"m_classType": "SetVariableAction", "m_SIGUID": 0, "m_variable": {"m_name": "rc_naechste_zeit", "m_type": 1, "isLocalVariable": true}, "m_intExpression": true, "m_expression": "{system_time} + ({lv=warte_minuten} * 60)"}, {"m_classType": "EndIfAction", "m_SIGUID": 0}, {"m_classType": "EndIfAction", "m_SIGUID": 0}], "m_constraintList": []}, "globalVariables": [], "userIcons": null, "aiFeedback": "Vereinfachte Logik: Der Timer zur nächsten Notifikation startet direkt beim Anzeigen (nicht mehr beim Wegwischen). Pro Tick (15 Min im Fenster 09:00-23:00, Debug: 30 Sek ohne Fenster): wenn rc_naechste_zeit erreicht ist -> zufälliger Check (0-14) via constraint-basierte Textauswahl, Notifikation mit fester ID und overwriteExisting (ersetzt eine noch offene alte automatisch), dann sofort rc_naechste_zeit = jetzt + zufällig 30-180 Min (Debug: 20-40 Sek). Wegwischen hat keine Funktion mehr - NotificationTrigger, Bestätigungs-Variable und Repost-Sicherheitsnetz wurden entfernt. Benachrichtigungszugriff wird nicht mehr benötigt. Alle Variablen lokal; Debug-Switch rc_debug in den lokalen Variablen des Makros."}